{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0074-s002", "text": "Bedömningen av eleven baserar sig inte enbart på resultaten i prov som skrivits på lektionerna, utan läraren bedömer elevens lärande och arbete under hela läsåret med olika metoder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T023043660858+0000-5/hb-c08-u0074-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 14.907210884353741, "peak": 0.31829833984375, "generation_seconds": 43.24141361308284, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0074-s003", "text": "Hen ger bedömningsrespons till såväl eleven som vårdnadshavarna och föräldrarna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T023043660858+0000-5/hb-c08-u0074-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.174965986394557, "peak": 0.297454833984375, "generation_seconds": 18.89032667502761, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0075-s001", "text": "I varje årskurs ges eleven ett läsårsbetyg när läsåret är slut.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T023043660858+0000-5/hb-c08-u0075-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.712108843537415, "peak": 0.270538330078125, "generation_seconds": 12.387552469037473, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0075-s002", "text": "I nionde klass får eleven ett avgångsbetyg.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T023043660858+0000-5/hb-c08-u0075-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.900952380952381, "peak": 0.263916015625, "generation_seconds": 9.708498795051128, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0075-s003", "text": "Betyget kan bestå av siffror, verbal bedömning eller både och.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T023043660858+0000-5/hb-c08-u0075-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.433469387755102, "peak": 0.26251220703125, "generation_seconds": 15.165670775109902, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0075-s004", "text": "Bedömningsskalan för siffervitsord är 4–10, där 4 är underkänt och 10 utmärkt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T023043660858+0000-5/hb-c08-u0075-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.6378231292517, "peak": 0.309112548828125, "generation_seconds": 24.543479830026627, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0075-s005", "text": "Utöver betyget får eleven och hens föräldrar information om bedömningen i till exempel samtal med läraren.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T023043660858+0000-5/hb-c08-u0075-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.05578231292517, "peak": 0.335174560546875, "generation_seconds": 22.125366200925782, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0075-s006", "text": "Skolan ger en bedömning av elevens uppförande i skolan minst en gång per år.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T023043660858+0000-5/hb-c08-u0075-s006.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.6873469387755105, "peak": 0.259033203125, "generation_seconds": 14.37532161991112, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
